<title>USA: Chase Manhattan unit sets $300 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Chase Manhattan unit sets $300 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Chase Manhattan Sub Holding Co, a unit of Chase Manhattan Corp, was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Chase Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER CHASE MANHATTAN SUB HOLDING CO</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 7.125 PCT  MATURITY 2/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.45   FIRST PAY DATE 8/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 7.203 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 57 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
